 d Hospital Corpsman school and was subsequently assigned tothe 31 Area Bra
 nch Medical Clinic at Camp Pendleton\, California.\n\nDetermined to become
  a SEAL\, Ansell returned to BUD/S in 2009. He successfully completed trai
 n\n\nAges: All ages\nLast synced: 2026-10-30 11:26 PDT
LOCATION:Meyer Green
